    "## Post-lecture quiz"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "raw",
   "metadata": {
    "format": "application/vnd.pretext+xml"
   },
   "source": [
    "<exercise label=\"mlb-quiz-6-1-post-1\">\n",
    "  <statement>\n",
    "    <p>Joseph Weizenbaum invented the bot</p>\n",
    "  </statement>\n",
    "  <choices randomize=\"no\">\n",
    "    <choice>\n",
    "      <statement>\n",
    "        <p>Elisha</p>\n",
    "      </statement>\n",
    "      <feedback>\n",
    "        <p>Not quite. The bot Joseph Weizenbaum built at MIT in the 1960s was named Eliza.</p>\n",
    "      </feedback>\n",
    "    </choice>\n",
    "    <choice correct=\"yes\">\n",
    "      <statement>\n",
    "        <p>Eliza</p>\n",
    "      </statement>\n",
    "      <feedback>\n",
    "        <p>Correct. Joseph Weizenbaum, an MIT scientist, developed Eliza in the 1960s.</p>\n",
    "      </feedback>\n",
    "    </choice>\n",
    "    <choice>\n",
    "      <statement>\n",
    "        <p>Eloise</p>\n",
    "      </statement>\n",
    "      <feedback>\n",
    "        <p>Not quite. Weizenbaum's bot was Eliza, built at MIT in the 1960s.</p>\n",
    "      </feedback>\n",
    "    </choice>\n",
    "  </choices>\n",
    "</exercise>"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "raw",
   "metadata": {
    "format": "application/vnd.pretext+xml"
   },
   "source": [
    "<exercise label=\"mlb-quiz-6-1-post-2\">\n",
    "  <statement>\n",
    "    <p>A conversational bot gives output based on</p>\n",
    "  </statement>\n",
    "  <choices randomize=\"no\">\n",
    "    <choice>\n",
    "      <statement>\n",
    "        <p>Randomly choosing predefined choices</p>\n",
    "      </statement>\n",
    "      <feedback>\n",
    "        <p>Not quite. The bot you built picks random replies, but bots like Eliza also parse the input to find keywords.</p>\n",
    "      </feedback>\n",
    "    </choice>\n",
    "    <choice>\n",
    "      <statement>\n",
    "        <p>Analyzing the input and using machine intelligence</p>\n",
    "      </statement>\n",
    "      <feedback>\n",
    "        <p>Not quite. Eliza parsed the input for keywords, but when it found no keyword, it gave a random reply.</p>\n",
    "      </feedback>\n",
    "    </choice>\n",
    "    <choice correct=\"yes\">\n",
    "      <statement>\n",
    "        <p>Both of these</p>\n",
    "      </statement>\n",
    "      <feedback>\n",
    "        <p>Correct. Some bots, like the one you built, pick random replies. Others, like Eliza, parse the input for keywords.</p>\n",
    "      </feedback>\n",
    "    </choice>\n",
    "  </choices>\n",
    "</exercise>"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "raw",
   "metadata": {
